    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02952",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "因此两人都下得非常精心，非常稳健，都没有错看漏看任何一手棋。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so both players played with great care and steadiness, and neither misread nor overlooked a single move.",
